  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「と、いうわけで購買コーナーにやってきたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いろんなグッズがあって、かわいいの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ある意味、商魂たくましい、とも言うのだけど。そこはあえてスルーなの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「転校生くんには付き合ってくれたお礼に、何か買ってあげたいところなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……いらない？　いやいや、ぜんぜん遠慮しなくていいの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたし、休みの日はずっとひとりで過ごしてたから、お小遣いもけっこう溜まってるし、気にしなくていいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それに、わたしはこう見えても君の先輩なんだから、見栄を張らせてほしいの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ほんとは、いかりんぐ……水泳部の後輩の鯱いかりちゃんに見せてあげないといけないところなのだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いかりんぐはすぐにわたしに噛みついてくるから、ちょっと苦手なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あ、『噛みつく』といっても、言葉で噛みついてくるわけじゃなくて、物理的になの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「見たことがあるかもしれないけど、いかりんぐの噛みつきはけっこう痛いの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「本人としては、甘噛みのつもりなんだろうけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「されるがままじゃ身体がもたないの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「このままじゃ、わたし『きずもの』になっちゃうの……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ううっ、歯形が残っちゃったらお嫁に行けないの！　そうなったら、いかりんぐには責任を取ってもらうの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……なんてね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたし、ずっと旧校舎にこもっていたから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「水泳部で頑張ってくれているみんなには感謝してもしきれないくらいなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「さてさて、水泳部の話は置いといて、遠慮せずに千円くらいのものを選ぶの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしも、お金が無限にあるわけじゃないから、千円以上のものは要相談なの……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「イルカ型のクッキーね。いい買い物なの。ちなみに、誰かにあげるつもりなの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……ううん、やっぱり答えなくていいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「こういうのを聞くのは、ちょっと野暮なの。いくらそういうのに疎いわたしだって、心得てるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしは何を買おうかな……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「うん。かわいいぬいぐるみがあったの。これにするの☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「熱帯魚のぬいぐるみなの。赤くて、鮮やかで。わたしの髪の色にそっくりなの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「本当は、金魚が一番好きなのだけど……さすがに、水族館に金魚はいないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「金魚には、金魚の生きる場所があって、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それは水族館のような、広くて、脚光を浴びるようなところではないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「家庭や、縁日の屋台のような、狭くて、庶民的な場所。そこが金魚の、生きる場所」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしはそれでいいと思うけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「こうやって実際に『水族館』という場所を見たら、なんとなく、思うの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「もしかしたら、金魚も……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「大海原や、水族館のような、広くて大きい場所に憧れてしまうんじゃないか、って」"
  }
